PRJNA379709	Mus musculus	10090.0		USA: Arizona	8	WGS	pubmed	28951889.0	28951889.0	Functional Changes in the Gut Microbiome Contribute to Transforming Growth Factor β-Deficient Colon Cancer.	Daniel SG	Hurwitz BL	Mammalia	"1. mSystems. 2017 Sep 26;2(5):e00065-17. doi: 10.1128/mSystems.00065-17. 
eCollection 2017 Sep-Oct.

Functional Changes in the Gut Microbiome Contribute to Transforming Growth 
Factor β-Deficient Colon Cancer.

Daniel SG(1), Ball CL(2), Besselsen DG(3), Doetschman T(2)(4)(5), Hurwitz 
BL(5)(6).

Author information:
(1)Department of Molecular and Cellular Biology, University of Arizona, Tucson, 
Arizona, USA.
(2)The University of Arizona Cancer Center, University of Arizona, Tucson, 
