(1)Department of Rheumatology and Immunology, The Second Affiliated Hospital of 
Guizhou University of Traditional Chinese Medicine, Guiyang, China.
(2)Department of Microbiology, College of Basic Medical Sciences, Dalian Medical 
University, Dalian, China.
(3)Puensum Genetech Institute, Wuhan, China.
(4)College of Animal Science and Veterinary Medicine, Heilongjiang Bayi 
