Extensive microbial diversity within the chicken gut microbiome revealed by 
metagenomics and culture.

Gilroy R(1), Ravi A(1), Getino M(2), Pursley I(2), Horton DL(2), Alikhan NF(1), 
Baker D(1), Gharbi K(3), Hall N(3)(4), Watson M(5), Adriaenssens EM(1), 
