Infant age inversely correlates with gut carriage of resistance genes, 
reflecting modifications in microbial carbohydrate metabolism during early life.

Xu X(1)(2)(3), Feng Q(1)(2)(4), Zhang T(1)(2), Gao Y(1)(2), Cheng Q(5), Zhang 
