PRJNA601162	Sus scrofa domesticus	9825.0		USA: Ohio	62	WGS	pubmed	36346230.0	36346230.0	Short-Term Tomato Consumption Alters the Pig Gut Microbiome toward a More Favorable Profile.	Goggans ML	Cooperstone JL	Mammalia	"1. Microbiol Spectr. 2022 Dec 21;10(6):e0250622. doi: 10.1128/spectrum.02506-22. 
Epub 2022 Nov 8.

Short-Term Tomato Consumption Alters the Pig Gut Microbiome toward a More 
Favorable Profile.

Goggans ML(1), Bilbrey EA(2), Quiroz-Moreno CD(2), Francis DM(3), Jacobi SK(4), 
Kovac J(5)(6), Cooperstone JL(1)(2).

Author information:
(1)Food Science and Technology, The Ohio State University, Columbus, Ohio, USA.
(2)Horticulture and Crop Science, The Ohio State University, Columbus, Ohio, 
USA.
(3)Horticulture and Crop Science, The Ohio State University, Wooster, Ohio, USA.
(4)Animal Sciences, The Ohio State University, Columbus, Ohio, USA.
(5)Food Science, The Pennsylvania State University, University Park, 
