PRJNA1417531					2	OTHER	pubmed	41969653.0	41969653.0	Characterization of a <i>Klebsiella pneumoniae</i> mutant strain wGF 1-2 with attenuated virulence, altered morphology, and reduced biofilm formation.	Dai Z	Wang J		"1. Front Cell Infect Microbiol. 2026 Mar 27;16:1761564. doi: 
