Protection against fibrosis by a bacterial consortium in metabolic 
dysfunction-associated steatohepatitis and the role of amino acid metabolism.

Kwan SY(1), Gonzales KA(1), Jamal MA(2), Stevenson HL(3), Tan L(4), Lorenzi 
