Mediterranean diet intervention in overweight and obese subjects lowers plasma 
cholesterol and causes changes in the gut microbiome and metabolome 
independently of energy intake.

Meslier V(#)(1), Laiola M(#)(2), Roager HM(#)(3), De Filippis F(2)(4), Roume 
