PRJNA1061085	Duzang pigs			China: Yunnan	9	WGS	pubmed	40094563.0	40094563.0	The stems and leaves of <i>Panax notoginseng</i> reduce the abundance of antibiotic resistance genes by regulating intestinal microbiota in Duzang pigs.	Cheng W	Zhao S	Mammalia	"1. Anim Biotechnol. 2025 Dec;36(1):2471785. doi: 10.1080/10495398.2025.2471785. 
