Comparative Metagenomic Analysis of Bacteriophages and Prophages in Gnotobiotic 
Mouse Models.

Ishola OA(1), Kublik S(1), Durai Raj AC(1), Ohnmacht C(2), Schulz S(1), Foesel 
BU(1), Schloter M(1)(3)(4).

