PRJNA271618	Papio cynocephalus	9556.0		Kenya	48	WGS	pubmed	25774601.0	25774601.0	Social networks predict gut microbiome composition in wild baboons.	Tung J	Archie EA	Mammalia	"1. Elife. 2015 Mar 16;4:e05224. doi: 10.7554/eLife.05224.

Social networks predict gut microbiome composition in wild baboons.

Tung J(1), Barreiro LB(2), Burns MB(3), Grenier JC(2), Lynch J(3), Grieneisen 
LE(4), Altmann J(5), Alberts SC(6), Blekhman R(3), Archie EA(5).

