Effects and Microbiota Changes Following Oral Lyophilized Fecal Microbiota 
Transplantation Capsules in Canine with Chronic Enteropathy After Parvovirus 
Infection: Case Report.

Liu S(1), Zhou B(2)(3), Liu L(2)(3), Zhong J(4), Zhang X(5), Jiang W(6), Liu 
H(1), Zhou Z(1), Peng G(1), Zhong Y(1), Zhang K(1), Zhong Z(1).

