Microbial Metabolism Modulates Antibiotic Susceptibility within the Murine Gut 
Microbiome.

Cabral DJ(1), Penumutchu S(1), Reinhart EM(1), Zhang C(2), Korry BJ(1), Wurster 
JI(1), Nilson R(1), Guang A(3), Sano WH(1), Rowan-Nash AD(1), Li H(2), Belenky 
P(4).

