Duodenal-jejunal bypass ameliorates MASLD in rats by regulating gut microbiota 
and bile acid metabolism through FXR pathways.

Ren M(1)(2), Xia Y(1), Pan H(2), Zhou X(1), Yu M(1), Ji F(1).

