Single cell genome sequencing of laboratory mouse microbiota improves taxonomic 
and functional resolution of this model microbial community.

Lyalina S(1), Stepanauskas R(2), Wu F(1), Sanjabi S(1)(3), Pollard KS(1)(4)(5).

