Using direct mechanical, enzymatic, and chemical extraction methods, the 
intestinal microbiome of the marine invertebrate Holothuria glaberrima was 
obtained. ITS and 16S rDNA regions were sequenced to enrich and investigate the 
prokaryotic and fungal diversity profiles from different anatomical regions 
within the sea cucumber's intestinal biology.

