PRJNA1186832	mouse			China:Hainan province	112	WGS	pubmed_metagenom_b1	40349120.0		Gut microbiota drives structural variation of exogenous probiotics to enhance colonization.				"1. Gut Microbes. 2025 Dec;17(1):2503371. doi: 10.1080/19490976.2025.2503371. Epub
