PRJNA1238482	snake			missing	9	OTHER	pubmed_metagenom_b1	40309103.0		Characterization and comparison of the fecal bacterial microbiota in Red Back Pine Root Snake (Oligodon formosanus) and Chinese Slug-Eating Snake (Pareas chinensis).				"1. Front Microbiol. 2025 Apr 16;16:1575405. doi: 10.3389/fmicb.2025.1575405. 
