PRJNA1134918	Bifidobacterium animalis			China:Chongqing	12	WGS	pubmed_metagenom_b1	40205678.0		Creatine-mediated ferroptosis inhibition is involved in the intestinal radioprotection of daytime-restricted feeding.				"1. Gut Microbes. 2025 Dec;17(1):2489072. doi: 10.1080/19490976.2025.2489072. Epub
