Dietary protein source alters gut microbiota composition and function.

Blakeley-Ruiz JA(1), Bartlett A(1)(2), McMillan AS(3), Awan A(1)(3), Walsh 
MV(1), Meyerhoffer AK(1), Vintila S(1), Maier JL(1), Richie TG(1), Theriot 
