Gut microbiome reveals the trophic variation and significant adaption of three 
sympatric forest-dwelling ungulates on the eastern Qinghai-Xizang Plateau.

Zhang H(1), Wang Y(1), Luo Z(1), Zhang B(1), Lan X(1), Xu L(2), Li X(2), Huang 
Z(2), Bai J(3), Hu D(4).

