How Host Phylogeny, Diet, and Habitat Affect Gut Microbial Diversity in Wild 
Snakes.

Zhang J(1)(2)(3), Fu C(1)(4), Tan S(1)(5), Lyu B(1)(2), Shu G(1)(2), Shi L(3), 
Wu Y(1)(2), Guo P(1)(2).

Author information:
(1)Faculty of Agriculture, Forestry and Food Engineering Yibin University Yibin 
