Mapping the metagenomic landscape: combined shotgun sequencing and quantitative 
PCR to profile gut metagenome-assembled genomes in marmosets following treatment 
with a broad-spectrum antibiotic cocktail.

Hernandez JB(1)(2)(3)(4), Abiodun M(1)(2)(3)(5), Hayer SS(1)(2)(3), Dickson 
