Discovery of BilV reveals a multienzymatic basis for bilirubin reduction across 
vertebrate gut microbiomes.

Jiang AK(1)(2), Grant MR(2), Arp G(2), Dufault-Thompson K(1), Clarke AM(2), Li 
Y(3), Lehman D(4), Jarmusch AK(4), Hall B(2)(5), Jiang X(1).

