Apis mellifera filamentous virus from a honey bee gut microbiome survey in 
Hungary.

Papp M(1), Tóth AG(1), Békési L(2), Farkas R(2), Makrai L(3), Maróti G(4)(5), 
Solymosi N(6)(7).

