The hologenome of Daphnia magna reveals possible DNA methylation and 
microbiome-mediated evolution of the host genome.

Chaturvedi A(1), Li X(1), Dhandapani V(1), Marshall H(1)(2), Kissane S(1), 
Cuenca-Cambronero M(1)(3), Asole G(4), Calvet F(4), Ruiz-Romero M(4), Marangio 
