PRJNA938989	Acinetobacter baumannii			China	41	WGS	pubmed_metagenom_b1	37333647.0		Population response of intestinal microbiota to acute Vibrio alginolyticus infection in half-smooth tongue sole (Cynoglossus semilaevis).				"1. Front Microbiol. 2023 May 15;14:1178575. doi: 10.3389/fmicb.2023.1178575. 
