Insights into plastic biodegradation: community composition and functional 
capabilities of the superworm (Zophobas morio) microbiome in styrofoam feeding 
trials.

Sun J(1), Prabhu A(1), Aroney STN(1), Rinke C(1).

Author information:
(1)Australian Centre for Ecogenomics, School of Chemistry and Molecular 
