Murine Gut Microbiome Meta-analysis Reveals Alterations in Carbohydrate 
Metabolism in Response to Aging.

You X(1), Dadwal UC(2), Lenburg ME(3), Kacena MA(2), Charles JF(1)(4).

Author information:
(1)Department of Orthopaedic Surgery, Brigham and Women's Hospital, Harvard 
Medical School, Boston, Massachusetts, USA.
(2)Orthopaedic Surgery, Indiana University School of Medicine, Indianapolis, 
