Captivity Influences the Gut Microbiome of Rhinopithecus roxellana.

Wang X(1)(2), Wang Z(1)(2), Pan H(3), Qi J(1), Li D(4), Zhang L(5), Shen Y(1), 
Xiang Z(6), Li M(1)(7).

