A Molecular Survey of Bacterial Species in the Guts of Black Soldier Fly Larvae 
(Hermetia illucens) Reared on Two Urban Organic Waste Streams in Kenya.

Shumo M(1)(2)(3)(4), Khamis FM(3), Ombura FL(3), Tanga CM(3), Fiaboe KKM(3)(5), 
