Neonatal Milk Fat Globule Membrane Supplementation During Breastfeeding 
Ameliorates the Deleterious Effects of Maternal High-Fat Diet on Metabolism and 
Modulates Gut Microbiota in Adult Mice Offspring in a Sex-Specific Way.

Ye L(1)(2), Zhang Q(1)(2), Xin F(3), Cao B(4), Qian L(1)(2), Dong Y(1)(2).

Author information:
(1)Xinhua Hospital, Shanghai Institute for Pediatric Research, Shanghai Jiao 
