Antibiotic resistomes discovered in the gut microbiomes of Korean swine and 
cattle.

Lim SK(1), Kim D(2), Moon DC(1), Cho Y(2), Rho M(2)(3).

Author information:
(1)Animal and Plant Quarantine Agency, Bacterial Disease Division, 177 Hyeoksin 
