Unraveling Assemblage, Functions and Stability of the Gut Microbiota of 
Blattella germanica by Antibiotic Treatment.

Domínguez-Santos R(1), Pérez-Cobas AE(2)(3), Artacho A(4), Castro JA(5), Talón 
I(1), Moya A(1)(4), García-Ferris C(1)(6), Latorre A(1)(4).

