Fungiculture in Termites Is Associated with a Mycolytic Gut Bacterial Community.

Hu H(#)(1), da Costa RR(#)(1), Pilgaard B(2), Schiøtt M(1), Lange L(2), Poulsen 
M(3).

Author information:
(1)Section for Ecology and Evolution, Department of Biology, University of 
